{
  "_comment": "Codex, OpenAI's coding agent for the terminal, as a command line program per account. One artifact per platform, the tarball of @openai/codex@{version}-<platform>, OpenAI's npm build of the program for that platform; its source set is npm and its digest the integrity registry.npmjs.org names for that build. The agent unpacks it without package/ into codex/package, so the program is package/vendor/<target>/bin/codex, beside codex-path/rg and codex-resources/. The versions are the dotted ones of @openai/codex, which leaves the alpha versions and the platform builds out, and each platform's digest is the build whose dist.tarball path is the artifact's file. user_copy_min_version is the lowest version of a person's own copy the module uses, the tested version.",
  "name": "codex",
  "title": "Codex",
  "description": "OpenAI's coding agent on the command line, for each account",
  "publisher": "OpenAI",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
